Output agent-demo-2.mp4
Set FontSize 15
Set Width 1180
Set Height 840
Set Padding 16
Set TypingSpeed 35ms
Set Theme "Dracula"
Set Shell bash

Hide
Type "unset CLAUDE_CODE_CHILD_SESSION CLAUDECODE CLAUDE_CODE_ENTRYPOINT; clear"
Enter
Show
Type "claude"
Enter
Sleep 15s
Type "Has Cleo Abram's take on nuclear energy changed over time? Keep it brief - a few dated quotes."
Sleep 1s
Enter
Sleep 300s
